OL,3,GNEWSAWe're growing jobs based on AI,
OL,4,Anot destroying them, says tech boss
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I think there's a huge fear of AI
OL,7,Ftaking away jobs. It's quite the
OL,8,Fopposite here," said Jutta Meier, who
OL,9,Fleads one of Wales' most successful
OL,10,Fsemiconductor companies.
OL,12,FIn a vast metal building on the edge of
OL,13,Fthe M4, scientists and engineers at IQE
OL,14,Fwear futuristic overalls as they create
OL,15,Fthe chips that fuel the revolution in
OL,16,Fartificial intelligence (AI).
OL,18,F"We are growing great jobs based on AI
OL,19,Fand supporting AI, quite the opposite
OL,20,Ffrom destroying jobs by AI," Meier
OL,21,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
