OL,3,GNEWSAWe're growing jobs based on AI,
OL,4,Anot destroying them, says tech boss
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK's AI minister Kanishka Narayan
OL,7,Fsaid Wales had to "reindustrialise
OL,8,Fitself" for an AI future, while also
OL,9,F"supporting everyone who is affected"
OL,10,Fby changing technology.
